# Dark, deaf keypad (titled Held reset until 2026-11-22: the title named the cause): the RS key (SW23) is stuck closed: RES_N is held low, so the 6502 and both 6530s stay in reset.
machine bw1
title "Dark, deaf keypad"
brief "The BW-1 powers on with every digit dark, and nothing on the keypad changes it. The self-test strap does not help."
fault switch SW23 closed
